CHAPTER VI
Design and Implementation
The design and implementation challenges of Matinao Memorial Cemetery Mapping and Management System for the Matinao community are covered in this chapter. This approach was created by the group to help the cemetery become more efficient with regard to plot management and visitor navigation. The system was created by the organization to specifically address their needs.
Technology is considered to be extremely important as it provides for faster and efficient daily cemetery operations. There are some cemeteries that are used to secure and manage burial information well. This study was conducted to design a system for exclusive use in Matinao Memorial Cemetery, one of the cemeteries in Matinao, Philippines. It was aimed at developing a system that could be efficient and accessible. The entire process has been organized through the help of the data gathered assisted by the use of specified technology.
A GPS-enabled Cemetery Mapping System with AI assistant was put into place to address the issue that the cemetery, and particularly the visitors, were having with locating burial plots. Additionally, the system is built with limitations for various users to guarantee that administrators can only view data that is permitted. Additionally, the system will focus on managing burial records and plot locations. The purpose of the study at Matinao Memorial Cemetery was to address concerns about plot location accuracy and reassure visitors about the accessibility of their loved ones' burial sites, whose advancement can be facilitated by the use of suitable technologies.

CHAPTER VII
Conclusion and Recommendation
Conclusion
  The results from Usability Testing show positive feedback from the participants. This research is significant for the cemetery and visitors where the system can help the cemetery to manage burial records by using GPS-enabled mapping to gathered data and information of burial locations. The visitors can also be guided about the burial locations via AI assistant and GPS navigation. All in all, Cemetery Mapping and Management System is a system that is useful for cemetery, visitors, and administrators in managing burial records and locating plot locations.
Recommendation
  It is recommended by the group to use this study as a basis or a guide for updating and enhancing other existing system. Although it is costly, it may be more efficient to have further research.
To other existing programs to determine the uniqueness of developing system. It is also recommended to improve the function of a system.

